    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Core Rulebook</i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You can <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Charge\" title=\"Charge\">Charge</a> with extra force.</p><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> Medium or larger size, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Base Attack Bonus\">Base Attack Bonus</a> +1</p><p><b>Effect:</b> When you <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Charge\" title=\"Charge\">Charge</a>, you gain an additional +2 bonus on your melee attack roll. If your melee attack hits, you deal additional damage equal to one-half your level.</p>",
